{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026IuI7tILJr41794904587.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>比亞迪董事長王傳福指，集團正積極推進海外「屬地生產」，反駁外界指中國製造業「搶飯碗」的說法。</p><p></p><p>比亞迪董事長王傳福稱︰「現在很多外界對中國製造有一些誤會，認為我們是搶了他們的『飯碗』，其實並不是。我們帶來的是新能源汽車，我們是填補了當地的空白。我們不只是把中國的技術輸出到全球，更希望把就業、把我們稅收帶到全球，形成互利、合作共贏。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T09:11:37.433885+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":166,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T07:14:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T07:20:56.977915+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T09:04:51.322852+00:00","content_hash":"3f4f90694857ab78d260088aa099d7cc758d84881da3a25213299357c7c77270","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-17T09:11:37.433885+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}